### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ARCHIVE RECORDS WORKFLOW - Archiving Sub-System
### Base Route: api/archive-records
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7010
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q2jA5PJdQpjOZ9F0wnU_2GCorgyE4UQlEIGWMeofAmQ

@recordId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@folderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@formId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@fileId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@departmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### HELPER GET ENDPOINTS - Fetch related entity IDs
### Use these to populate the variable placeholders above
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### A. GET DEPARTMENT BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### B. GET FOLDER BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ArchiveSystem/Folders/{{folderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### C. GET ARCHIVE RECORD BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### D. GET ARCHIVE DELETION REQUEST BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-deletion-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET ARCHIVE RECORD BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. GET RECORDS BY FOLDER ID (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/folder/{{folderId}}?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. GET RECORDS BY FORM ID (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/form/{{formId}}?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. CREATE ARCHIVE RECORD (multipart/form-data)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="FolderId"

{{folderId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="FormId"

{{formId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DepartmentId"

00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Files"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
------Boundary--

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. UPDATE ARCHIVE RECORD (multipart/form-data)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="FolderId"

{{folderId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="FormId"

{{formId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ReplaceFiles"

false
------Boundary--

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. ADD FILES TO RECORD (multipart/form-data)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}/files
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./document1.pdf
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="image1.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./image1.png
------Boundary--

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 7. GET FILES METADATA (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}/files/metadata?page=1&pageSize=10&includeDeleted=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 8. GET PAGINATED FILES (NEW - with sorting, search, filtering)
### Supports: MetadataOnly | WithUrls | WithData
### SortBy: CreatedAt | FileName | FileSize
### SortOrder: Asc | Desc
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}/files/paginated?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&mode=MetadataOnly&sortBy=CreatedAt&sortOrder=Desc&searchTerm=&fileTypes=application/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 9. HEAD PAGINATED FILES (NEW - headers only, MetadataOnly mode)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}/files/paginated?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&mode=MetadataOnly&sortBy=CreatedAt&sortOrder=Desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 10. DOWNLOAD FILE (inline or attachment)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}/files/{{fileId}}?download=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 11. DOWNLOAD FILE BY ID (NEW - download without recordId)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/files/{{fileId}}?download=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 12. DOWNLOAD ZIP BUNDLE (NEW)
### Compression: Optimal | Fastest | NoCompression | SmallestSize
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}/files/zip?flatten=false&compression=Optimal&includeMetadata=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 13. DOWNLOAD ZIP BUNDLE WITH PASSWORD (NEW)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}/files/zip?flatten=true&password=MySecretPass&compression=Fastest&includeMetadata=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 14. REMOVE FILE FROM RECORD
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 15. DELETE ARCHIVE RECORD
### Requires DepartmentArchiveLeader authorization
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/archive-records/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
